<title>USA: RFS Hotel completes mortgage financing.</title>
<headline>RFS Hotel completes mortgage financing.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>RFS Hotel Investors Inc said on Wednesday that it completed a $75 million commercial mortgage bond financing.</p>
<p>The company will use the proceeds to pay back borrowings under its bank line of credit and to fund previously announced hotel development.</p>
<p>The bonds are secured by first priority mortgage liens on 15 hotels owned by RFS. The company owns 52 hotels in 23 states.</p>
</text>
